---
import CaseStudyLayout from "../../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro";
import CaseStudyImage from "../../components/CaseStudyImage.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const slug = "comm-bud";
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title="Comm Bud"
  description="Comm Bud app makes finding a contractor for a construction project easier. My team designed this product during a hackathon Build the Beauty, organized by L'Oreal, Saint-Gobain, and Generator Pomysłów. The app received a 3rd award in the hackathon contest."
  problem="How to streamline the construction process for private investors, while promoting sustainable development practices?"
  solution="An app that connects investors with potential contractors."
  slug={slug}
  heroImage="commBud"
  heroAlt="Three phone mockups of the Comm Bud contractor profile and booking confirmation screens on a green background"
  prev={{ href: `${base}/work/talebook-autotag`, label: "Talebook Autotag" }}
  next={{ href: `${base}/work/march-for-science`, label: "March for Science" }}
>
  <section class="case-study-section">
    <h3 class="case-study-heading">Research</h3>
    <div class="case-study-text">
      <p>During the hackathon, we conducted interviews with private investors to learn about the pain points and frustration during the construction process.</p>
      <p>Based on their feedback and the hackathon challenge we developed a persona that guided the rest of the design process.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-study-media" data-columns="2">
      <CaseStudyImage slug={slug} name="research-1" alt="Persona card for a private investor, listing goals and frustrations" />
      <CaseStudyImage slug={slug} name="research-2" alt="FigJam board synthesizing investor interview notes" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-study-section">
    <h3 class="case-study-heading">Ideation</h3>
    <div class="case-study-text">
      <p>Through both individual and collective brainstorming sessions, we explored numerous solution ideas. We selected one idea by using a prioritization matrix.</p>
      <p>The solution to the discovered issues was an app helping investors connect with potential contractors, aiming to address communication issues, unexpected delays, and accountability concerns in construction projects.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-study-media" data-columns="2">
      <CaseStudyImage slug={slug} name="ideation-1" alt="Affinity diagram clustering brainstormed solution ideas" />
      <CaseStudyImage slug={slug} name="ideation-2" alt="Prioritization matrix plotting solution ideas" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-study-section">
    <h3 class="case-study-heading">Design</h3>
    <div class="case-study-text">
      <p>It includes a rating system reflecting contractors' sustainable practices, providing valuable information for investors, and promoting sustainable development.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-study-media">
      <CaseStudyImage slug={slug} name="design-1" alt="Booking calendar and schedule screens on a green background" />
    </div>
    <div class="case-study-media">
      <CaseStudyImage slug={slug} name="design-2" alt="Three phone mockups of contractor profile states on a green background" />
    </div>
    <div class="case-study-media">
      <CaseStudyImage slug={slug} name="design-3" alt="Composite showcase of the Comm Bud app screens on a green background" />
    </div>
  </section>
</CaseStudyLayout>
